# A1-P00 — Before the Ground. Source: Production Master 2.1, lines 1132–1157.
# Black screen, about twenty seconds, not playable. Plays when New Game opens
# the crash site. The flight attendant is Seraphina; she isn't named here. The
# player meets her again in Chapter 2 and the "rows" habit is how they'll
# recognise her (she counts people).
# The Voice is Mira. Unnamed until much later; keep it that way.

~ start
do black_screen
do sfx seatbelt_chime
Flight Attendant: Rows eighteen to thirty, clear. Cabin's secure.
do sfx phone_buzz
Voice: Call me when you land, okay?
Kaelen: I will. Promise.
do sfx turbulence
Flight Attendant: Ladies and gentlemen, please stay seated with your seatbelts fastened.
do sfx cup_falls
Flight Attendant: Heads down! Brace, brace! Heads down, stay down!
Passenger: Where's my daughter? I can't see her— where is she?
Passenger: I can't— I can't breathe—
Kaelen: Hey. Hey, look at me. You're okay. Just look at me.
do white_out
